  <item>
    <title>《奉爱瑜伽》：爱是平静的喜悦，爱是通往自由的捷径 | 第179期读书会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69dbc03be2c8be315506fb07</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69dbc03be2c8be315506fb07</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期推荐书籍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《奉爱瑜伽》，[印]斯瓦米·辩喜，富瑜译， 商务印书馆，2025.07</span></p><span></span><p><span>奉爱瑜伽是印度教中的一种修行方式，旨在对于任何人格神祗奉献最诚的敬爱，它也是印度教通往解脱的三条路径之一。</span></p><span></span><p><span>辩喜出生于加尔各答的卡亚斯塔家庭，也就是专门做文书记录的种性家族，从小对宗教和灵性感兴趣。1893年，他打破了印度教徒不得出海远游的禁锢，前往美国芝加哥参与世界宗教大会，对西方学术界产生了巨大的影响，同时他的思想也在西欧和北美地区受到热烈的欢迎。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>言十、殊昱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 书籍背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 现代生活中的瑜伽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> 辩喜根据奉爱的强烈程度分为5种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a> 对事物和生活的热爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1510">25:10</a> 奉爱的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 奉爱瑜伽的入门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1617">26:57</a> 偶像崇拜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a> 导师古鲁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a> 成为古鲁的资格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a> 成为弟子的资格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> 弃绝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> 爱的形式是尊重</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>I Don't Want to Play Around </span></em><span>- Ace Spectrum</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：三无茶舍</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫描下方二维码，解锁往期精彩内容</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiodzbFEVNAjwAC3vApHF0p3bA3t.png"></figure>]]></description>
