    <guid isPermaLink="false">69caae7fe2c8be3155f0a5db</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>借由民生美术馆近期《色彩之巅 法国蓬皮杜》展览聊聊颜色背后的诸多故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当我们聊起色彩心理学，颜色是如何影响人们的感受的？为什么蓝色在即可以带来寂静悲伤之感，又可以象征尊贵神圣？</span></p><span></span><p><span>到底是谁在定义颜色的社会共识？颜色既可以陈列在美术馆里被人凝视，也可以在全球化市场流通中缔造商业奇迹</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>言十、殊昱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 色彩之巅 法国蓬皮杜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 视觉体验在场的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 克莱因蓝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 爱死机短片《齐马蓝》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 人对颜色的定义权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 潘通：颜色帝国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 色彩全球化标准：对色彩话语权的垄断</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bosques de mi Mente - Estoy solo, respondio el eco</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：三无茶舍</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫描下方二维码，解锁往期精彩内容</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiodzbFEVNAjwAC3vApHF0p3bA3t.png"></figure>]]></description>
