    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期推荐书籍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《子平基础概要》，梁湘润，行卯出版社，2009</span></p><span></span><p><span>人越大好像越发现身边有很多事情自己都无法控制，人会感到焦虑迷茫，如果听友们有这样的困惑不妨也把这本书拿来当作一本哲学书看看。从现代生活的视角看待命理，是对个人和外部世界的一种理解方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人的一生都在修行渡过自己的课题，我们无法去改变他人的命运，把关注点放在自己身上反而更重要。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlyF0SmX3bC-ImTB1aoeKMQrZmsy.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>言十、殊昱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 书籍背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 八字与四柱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjI9_JHjbmNyaVzDf1UbaKg01a37.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 八字与五行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1394">23:14</a> 十神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2353">39:13</a> 六亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a> 看命流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2946">49:06</a> 刑冲合害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3328">55:28</a> 一些想法</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>君自兰芳 - 骆集益/周志华</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：三无茶舍</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫描下方二维码，解锁往期精彩内容</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiodzbFEVNAjwAC3vApHF0p3bA3t.png"></figure>]]></description>
