    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696e4278ef1cf272a7489cf6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696e4278ef1cf272a7489cf6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期推荐书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>《穿破黑暗：灯塔的故事》[意]维罗妮卡·德拉·多拉，译林方尖碑</span></p><span></span><p><span>灯塔像大图钉一样散落在海岸线，锚固住了大海的形状，也守护着人类世界和混沌水域之间的边界。它们的孤立和坚韧使其成为复杂的隐喻。很少有其他人造建筑拥有这种奇特的吸引力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>随着技术的发展，总会有一天灯塔这个庞然大物会被遗忘在历史里，而其精神的信标却在人类记忆中永存。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqRshTWY-tCNKR2gae0eEcRGa8s4.png"></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>言十、殊昱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 维罗妮卡·德拉·多拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> 灯塔作为特殊人造构筑物的神秘感和吸引力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 各种类型的灯塔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpIF6mIZLOzlPntukV5tCGwZQZSl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 安定与危险的双重身份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="610">10:10</a> 灯塔，海岸线的地图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFcursfM24X-r9kNTXeDkzKk3gq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 灯塔的移动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 灯塔对于守塔人，死人的活墓地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 勇气奉献VS惊悚疯狂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 灯塔：飞鸟的屠杀者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 不仅有光，声音引导方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 从被凝视到符号化，作为记忆信标长存</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bosques de mi Mente - Estoy solo, respondio el eco</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：三无茶舍</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫描下方二维码，解锁往期精彩内容</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiodzbFEVNAjwAC3vApHF0p3bA3t.png"></figure>]]></description>
