    <title>2025年度榜单：与作品解读，对话；与自我接纳，和解；与世界并肩，共振 | 第171期读书会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6951525b2db086f897707c84</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6951525b2db086f897707c84</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年度书单是我们连续第四个年头为听友们带来量大管饱的书单，电影榜单以及游戏榜单。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在过去的这一年里，我们阅读的书籍类型和收获的内容与2022年第一期年度榜单不同，从青涩逐渐走向成熟，从向外探索走向与自我对话，与作者的心灵对话。</span></p><span></span><p><span>期待2026年可以同听友们一起遇见更多打开我们人生视野广度的作品，不论是书籍，电影还是游戏等不同类型，让我们相聚在播客的声音电波之中。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>言十、殊昱、老蔚</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>年度书籍榜单</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 《爱是地狱冥犬》，[美]布考斯基 著/译者：徐淳刚，商务印书馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> 中国国际广播出版社，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/series/76448" data-url="https://book.douban.com/series/76448"><span>游戏文化经典译丛</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《说服性游戏：: 电子游戏的表达力》</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%9D%8E%E6%B4%8B%20%E5%BC%A0%E5%AE%87%E6%B8%85%20%E4%B8%BB%E7%BC%96" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%9D%8E%E6%B4%8B%20%E5%BC%A0%E5%AE%87%E6%B8%85%20%E4%B8%BB%E7%BC%96"><span>李洋 张宇清 主编</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4644146" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4644146"><span>[美]伊恩·博格斯特 著</span></a><span>/译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4645038" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4645038"><span>丁幼晗</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《投币机里的美国：重启电子游戏厅的男孩时光》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4645039" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4645039"><span>[美]卡莉・A.科库雷克 著</span></a><span>/译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4644147" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4644147"><span>耿游子民</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《宅兹游戏：从沉浸到归化》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4645042" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4645042"><span>[马耳他]戈登·卡莱亚</span></a><span> 著/译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%9B%B9%E7%90%AA" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%9B%B9%E7%90%AA"><span>曹琪</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>《游戏中的算法文化》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4612692" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4612692"><span>[美]亚历山大·R.加洛韦 著</span></a><span>/译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E7%8E%8B%E6%9D%89" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E7%8E%8B%E6%9D%89"><span>王杉</span></a></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> &nbsp;《1941：德国走向失败的那一年》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E5%AE%89%E5%BE%B7%E9%B2%81%C2%B7%E7%BA%B3%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94%E6%96%AF%E5%9F%BA" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E5%AE%89%E5%BE%B7%E9%B2%81%C2%B7%E7%BA%B3%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94%E6%96%AF%E5%9F%BA"><span>[美]安德鲁·纳戈尔斯基</span></a><span> 著/译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4617370" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4617370"><span>袁鑫</span></a><span> ，: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/press/2622" data-url="https://book.douban.com/press/2622"><span>社会科学文献出版社</span></a><span> - 甲骨文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 《独立战争与世界重启：一部新的十八世纪晚期全球史》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4653483" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4653483"><span>[美] 马修·洛克伍德</span></a><span> 著译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E5%88%98%E6%98%A5%E8%8A%B3" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E5%88%98%E6%98%A5%E8%8A%B3"><span>刘春芳</span></a><span> ，译林出版社-方尖碑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> &nbsp;《运动场内外：近代江南的女子体育（1895—1937）》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4613751" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4613751"><span>游鉴明</span></a><span> 著，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/press/2476" data-url="https://book.douban.com/press/2476"><span>广西师范大学出版社</span></a><span> - 大学问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 《奉爱瑜伽》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%96%AF%E7%93%A6%E7%B1%B3%C2%B7%E8%BE%A8%E5%96%9C" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%96%AF%E7%93%A6%E7%B1%B3%C2%B7%E8%BE%A8%E5%96%9C"><span>印] 斯瓦米·辨喜</span></a><span> 著，译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E5%AF%8C%E7%91%9C" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E5%AF%8C%E7%91%9C"><span>富瑜</span></a><span> ， 商务印书馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1638">27:18</a> 《子平真诠评注》，沈孝瞻著， 梁湘润译，中医古籍出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a>《地下室手记》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/1070126" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/1070126"><span>[俄] 陀思妥耶夫斯基</span></a><span> 著，译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4532705" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4532705"><span>臧仲伦</span></a><span> ，漓江出版社</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 《栖居于大地之上》,</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E5%B8%83%E9%B2%81%E8%AF%BA%C2%B7%E6%8B%89%E5%9B%BE%E5%B0%94" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E5%B8%83%E9%B2%81%E8%AF%BA%C2%B7%E6%8B%89%E5%9B%BE%E5%B0%94"><span>[法] 布鲁诺·拉图尔</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4636270" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4636270"><span>[法] 尼古拉·张</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4609696" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4609696"><span>[法国] 布鲁诺·拉图尔</span></a><span> 著， 译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4612373" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4612373"><span>蓝江</span></a><span> ， 广西师范大学出版社 - 大学问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 《穿破黑暗: 灯塔的故事》,</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E7%BB%B4%E7%BD%97%E5%A6%AE%E5%8D%A1%C2%B7%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89%C2%B7%E5%A4%9A%E6%8B%89" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E7%BB%B4%E7%BD%97%E5%A6%AE%E5%8D%A1%C2%B7%E5%BE%B7%E6%8B%89%C2%B7%E5%A4%9A%E6%8B%89"><span>[意] 维罗妮卡·德拉·多拉</span></a><span> 著，译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/author/4617089" data-url="https://book.douban.com/author/4617089"><span>马睿</span></a><span> ， 译林出版社 - 方尖碑</span></p><span></span><p><span>《空中花园：追踪一座扑朔迷离的世界奇迹》，</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%96%AF%E8%92%82%E8%8A%AC%E5%A6%AE%C2%B7%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%A9" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%96%AF%E8%92%82%E8%8A%AC%E5%A6%AE%C2%B7%E8%BE%BE%E5%88%A9"><span>[英国] 斯蒂芬妮·达利</span></a><span> 著，译者: </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E8%90%A7%E8%B0%99" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E8%90%A7%E8%B0%99"><span>萧谙</span></a><span> ，译林出版社 - 方尖碑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2367">39:27</a> 《热风》，鲁迅，广西师范大学出版社，野Spring</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>年度电影榜单</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2546">42:26</a>《新世纪福音战士：终》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2951">49:11</a>《还有明天》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3479">57:59</a> 《戏台》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>年度游戏榜单</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3781">01:03:01</a>《f1狂飙飞车》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3925">01:05:25</a> 《巴别塔圣歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4090">01:08:10</a> 《博德之门3》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4201">01:10:01</a>《地平线5》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主题音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Rest in Your Mind - Fridrik Karlsson</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：三无茶舍</span></p><