  <item>
    <title>《中国古典园林分析》：空间的谐趣与游戏关卡设计 | 第169期读书会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6936ed434ef12f9fe99a0ec9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6936ed434ef12f9fe99a0ec9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期推荐书籍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《中国古典园林分析》，彭一刚，中国建筑工业出版社，1981.12.01</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiRNqJVYLNpcYByGrmEabTQqzGnB.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>做建筑空间和游戏关卡都有共同的特点：整理人在此时此刻此处，直觉所感受到的一切信息点。这次我们讲这本书，不讲建筑和园林设计理论本身，而是借用这本书的内容，来分析游戏的关卡设计。</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>言十、殊昱</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 书籍简介</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 推荐这本书的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> 游戏设计理论与实践教材的矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 东西方园林的差异与游戏设计的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1083">18:03</a> 关卡设计的最基本需求：目标与达成路径</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1332">22:12</a> 向内看与向外看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> 看与被看</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 主从与重点层级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a> 空间对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2467">41:07</a> 藏与露</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2649">44:09</a> 引导与暗示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2773">46:13</a> 疏与密</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2856">47:36</a> 虚与实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> 蜿蜒曲折</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3056">50:56</a> 仰视与俯视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3251">54:11</a> 空间序列</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3591">59:51</a> 反例：当关卡设计作为一种视觉奇观</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3966">01:06:06</a> 总结</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主题音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>千人千面 - 陈致逸</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：三无茶舍</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫描下方二维码，解锁往期精彩内容</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiodzbFEVNAjwAC3vApHF0p3bA3t.png"></figure>]]></description>
