    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期推荐书籍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《我不与人争 兰多诗选》[英]沃尔特·萨维奇·兰多，刘守兰译，2024</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgMYSi-S0jMvrGAeBbZQszOiBKDL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>我不与人争，因为无人值得我争斗：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我爱自然，其次，艺术：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我烤着生命之火温暖双手；</span></p><span></span><p><span>火要熄了，我也准备走了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>言十、殊昱、老蔚</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 《我不与人争》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 沃尔特·萨维奇·兰多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 恋爱中的诗《美丽的姑娘》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 读诗就是看他的生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a> 《这里躺着兰多》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 《有人说我们不过是尘埃》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a>《我们匆匆赶到必须渡越的河畔》&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 《在骚塞的墓前》&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1770">29:30</a> 文字传达共鸣</span></p><span></span><p><span>主题音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>丢火车乐队 - 火车日记2024</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系我们</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：三无茶舍</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫描下方二维码，解锁往期精彩内容</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiodzbFEVNAjwAC3vApHF0p3bA3t.png"></figure>]]></description>
